{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithm-attention","title":"算法与注意力经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/mechanisms/algorithm-attention","wordCount":2034,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"算法与注意力经济\">算法与注意力经济</h1><p>1971 年，经济学家西蒙（Herbert Simon）写下一句日后被反复引用的话：信息的丰富造成了注意力的贫乏。当信息近乎免费、无限供给时，真正稀缺的不再是信息本身，而是接收信息的人类注意力。数字平台的商业模式恰好建立在这条稀缺性之上：它们不卖内容，而是免费供给海量内容以聚拢注意力，再把这份注意力卖给广告主。驱动这台机器运转的核心引擎，是不断优化「参与度」的推荐算法。理解算法如何分配注意力，就理解了平台如何把人的时间炼成利润。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>注意力经济的闭环由内容供给、算法分发、参与度反馈、广告变现四环构成，算法是把注意力转化为可售商品的枢纽。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[海量内容供给] --&gt; ALG[推荐算法]&#10;  ALG --&gt; F[个性化信息流]&#10;  F --&gt; E[用户参与: 停留点击分享]&#10;  E --&gt; D[行为数据回流]&#10;  D --&gt; ALG&#10;  E --&gt; AD[注意力打包出售]&#10;  AD --&gt; R[广告收入]&#10;  R --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  C[海量内容供给] --&gt; ALG[推荐算法]\n  ALG --&gt; F[个性化信息流]\n  F --&gt; E[用户参与: 停留点击分享]\n  E --&gt; D[行为数据回流]\n  D --&gt; ALG\n  E --&gt; AD[注意力打包出售]\n  AD --&gt; R[广告收入]\n  R --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>传统媒体</th>\n<th>算法平台</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容来源</td>\n<td>编辑生产</td>\n<td>用户与第三方海量供给</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分发逻辑</td>\n<td>统一编排</td>\n<td>个性化算法排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化目标</td>\n<td>发行量/收视率</td>\n<td>单用户参与度时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈速度</td>\n<td>慢（周期统计）</td>\n<td>实时（每次滑动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变现单位</td>\n<td>版面/时段</td>\n<td>单次曝光/点击</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"注意力的稀缺性与变现\">注意力的稀缺性与变现</h2><p>把注意力当作经济品看待，立刻得到一组约束。每个人每天的清醒注意力总量大致固定，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，它在所有争夺者之间零和分配：平台 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 获得的份额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i t_i \\le T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是一场零和的「时间战争」——一个平台多占一分钟，别的平台或线下生活就少一分钟。平台的收入则近似与它捕获的注意力成正比：设每单位注意力的变现率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>，则收入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i \\approx \\rho \\cdot t_i \\cdot u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户数。这个简单关系解释了平台的根本动机：在用户数既定时，最大化人均停留时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。注意力是平台真正的原材料，参与度是它的产量指标，这把我们引向算法的优化目标问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参与度优化及其偏向\">参与度优化及其偏向</h2><p>推荐算法表面是「猜你喜欢」，实质是「最大化你停留」。系统对每条候选内容预测一组信号——点击概率、观看时长、点赞与转发概率——再加权排序。形式上，内容 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的排序分</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{score}_j = \\sum_k w_k \\cdot \\hat{p}_{k,j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}_{k,j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各类参与信号的预测值、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重。问题出在优化目标本身：能最大化参与度的内容，未必是对用户有益的内容。激起愤怒、恐惧、猎奇的内容天然更「黏」，因而被算法系统性地放大。这不是工程师的恶意，而是「以参与度为目标」这一设定的逻辑后果——算法忠实地优化了它被给定的指标，而该指标与用户福祉、信息质量并不对齐。这种目标错配是平台被指责助长极化、成瘾、虚假信息的机制根源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优化目标的权衡与替代\">优化目标的权衡与替代</h3><p>把目标从「参与度」换掉并非没有代价，这正是平台的真实困境。参与度之所以被选中，是因为它可观测、可实时归因，并且与广告收入直接挂钩；改用「用户满意度」之类更贴近福祉的目标，则面临难以测量、易被博弈的问题——用户自报的满意度与实际行为常常背离。因此平台实际上面临一组权衡：目标越贴近短期变现，越容易放大成瘾与极化；目标越贴近长期福祉，越难量化、越难向广告主交代。</p>\n<p>可操作的方向不是简单换指标，而是给指标加约束：对已知有害内容降权、对停留时长设边际递减收益、在排序中混入探索性内容以打破回音室。这些做法本质上是在「单一目标最大化」之外引入多目标平衡，代价是短期参与度可能下降。这也解释了为何单靠平台自我调节不足——只要收入仍绑定参与度，任何偏离该目标的调整都会直接压低当期财报，于是外部监管（如强制提供非个性化选项）成为必要的纠偏力量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据飞轮与个性化的双刃\">数据飞轮与个性化的双刃</h2><p>算法越用越准，靠的是行为数据的实时回流。你的每一次滑动、停留、跳过都是给模型的标注，模型据此更新对你的画像，下一刻推得更贴合。这构成了与<a href=\"../foundations/data-as-factor\">数据作为生产要素</a>中「数据飞轮」同构的闭环，只是这里转动的是注意力：参与产生数据，数据改进推荐，推荐提升参与。</p>\n<p>个性化是把双刃剑。一面它降低信息搜寻成本、提升匹配效率，是真实的体验改进；另一面它制造「过滤气泡」与回音室，让每个人看到被算法定制的现实，侵蚀公共信息的共享基础。更深一层，个性化所依赖的对每个人的细颗粒画像，正是<a href=\"../labor/surveillance-capitalism\">监控资本主义</a>所说的「行为剩余」的采集过程——算法分发与行为监控是同一枚硬币的两面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注意力作为隐性劳动与平台权力\">注意力作为隐性劳动与平台权力</h2><p>当用户「免费」使用一个平台时，他们其实在以注意力和行为数据支付。从<a href=\"two-sided-markets\">双边市场与定价</a>的视角看，用户是被补贴的诱饵侧；从价值创造的视角看，用户的浏览、评论、内容贡献本身就是被无偿占有的<a href=\"../labor/digital-labor-value\">数字劳动与价值创造</a>。注意力经济因此不仅是商业模式，也是一套隐性的价值榨取装置。</p>\n<p>这套装置赋予平台一种新型权力：对公共注意力的分配权。谁的内容被看见、什么议题被放大、哪种情绪被奖励，越来越由少数平台的算法决定。这种权力是不透明且不受问责的——直到监管介入。欧盟《数字服务法》要求超大型平台披露推荐系统逻辑、提供非个性化选项，欧盟《平台工作指令》则要求对劳动场景的算法决策可解释，二者都是试图把算法对注意力与机会的分配权重新纳入公共监督，详见<a href=\"../governance/data-sovereignty\">数据主权与监管</a>。</p>\n<p>注意力分配权的政治含义在 2026 年愈发凸显。当一国相当比例的公民通过同一套算法获取新闻与观点时，这套算法的优化目标就不再只是商业问题，而是关乎公共舆论的形成。算法奖励冲突与极端、抑制温和与复杂，会潜移默化地重塑一个社会的讨论方式——这并非任何人的蓄意设计，而是「最大化参与度」这一目标在公共领域的外溢后果。这也是为什么单靠平台自律远远不够：商业激励与公共利益在此处结构性地不一致，必须靠外部的透明度义务与可问责机制来矫正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>信息泛滥使注意力成为真正稀缺品，平台免费供给内容以聚拢注意力再卖给广告主；</li>\n<li>注意力是固定总量的零和资源，平台收入近似正比于捕获的人均停留时长；</li>\n<li>推荐算法以参与度为优化目标，会系统性放大易上瘾、易激怒的内容，造成目标与福祉的错配；</li>\n<li>行为数据实时回流形成注意力版数据飞轮，个性化兼具效率提升与过滤气泡之害；</li>\n<li>用户以注意力与数据隐性付费，平台由此获得对公共注意力的分配权，正被数字服务法等监管纳入问责。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"算法与注意力经济","id":"算法与注意力经济"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"注意力的稀缺性与变现","id":"注意力的稀缺性与变现"},{"level":2,"text":"参与度优化及其偏向","id":"参与度优化及其偏向"},{"level":3,"text":"优化目标的权衡与替代","id":"优化目标的权衡与替代"},{"level":2,"text":"数据飞轮与个性化的双刃","id":"数据飞轮与个性化的双刃"},{"level":2,"text":"注意力作为隐性劳动与平台权力","id":"注意力作为隐性劳动与平台权力"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"双边市场与定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/mechanisms/two-sided-markets"},"next":{"title":"零工经济与平台劳动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/labor/gig-platform-labor"}}